console: /help
console:   Commands: help time weather gamemode difficulty tp give summon kill clear effect xp locate seed spawnpoint setblock
console:   Tab completes names; arrow keys recall earlier commands.
console: /time set noon
console:   Set the time to 6000
console: /give diamond 5
console:   Gave 5 [Diamond] to Player
console: /give hisser_head
console:   Gave 1 [Hisser Head] to Player
console: /locate sea_temple
console:   The nearest Sea Temple is at [296, ~, 736] (782 blocks away)
console: /summon hisser
console:   Summoned new Hisser
console: <Player> hello
console: /tp ~ ~2 ~
console:   Teleported Player to 8.5, 88.0, 8.5
console: /xp 5L
console:   Gave 5 experience levels to Player
console: /bogus
